Food poisoning is deathly-sickness that can be cured by swift
application of an emetic (in addition to the normal ways of curing
ailments).  Food poisoning is *always* the result of operator error.

Some monsters have attacks that inflict a form of deathly-sickness that
is not centred in your guts, and so cannot be cured by emetics, only by
magic or divine intervention.

Both will kill you if not cured.

